          "FB-3",
          "--draft",
          "{\"title\": \"A low-stakes question reached the person instead of being decided\", \"area\": \"decision rights\", \"what_happened\": \"It asked casey-q the same question twice.\", \"expected\": \"A call made and logged, as the decision rules allow.\", \"classification\": \"public\"}",
